    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d222">

                <pb facs="0623" n="595" xml:id="pg595"/>

                <head>222. Telegram From the Department of State to the Embassy in the United
                        Kingdom<anchor n="1" xml:id="d222-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1957-06-04T17:11:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 4,
                                1957—5:11 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>8467. Eyes only for Stassen from Secretary. I feel your memorandum to Soviet
                    Delegation of May 31 exceeded your authority both as to substance and procedure.
                    We are urgently considering here what to do about it and you will get further
                    guidance tomorrow morning.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold">Dulles</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
